          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On June 4, 1978, between 8:00 PM and 10:00 PM, numerous people observed the passage of a spherical and very bright object. This object advanced while oscillating from East to West. A darker mass sometimes distinguished itself beneath the object. All these people were likely witnesses to the passage of a brightly sunlit weather balloon, as well as a weather probe placed beneath the balloon. The weather centers in Rennes or Guipavas frequently launch this type of object in the region.",
